        "finding": "SISA's CE margin over FoX narrows with scale (0.022→0.014→0.004 nats). Samba's lead over SISA grows (tie→0.017→0.049). Architecture rankings thus change with scale.",
        "proposed_claim": "Architecture-induced loss differences are scale-dependent between 50M and 369M.",
