    "problems": "The tested models span 50M to 369M parameters; there is no scaling-law fit or prediction test. Several 369M comparisons use one seed. The paper characterizes zero-shot downstream benchmarks as supplementary, and some results are reported only as aggregate ranges or qualitative trends.",
